Package: scarecrow-term
Version: 0.1.0
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7)
Maintainer: Anubis Darkwatch <anubis@anubisdarkwatch>
Description: Scarecrow Terminal — RX-only sub-GHz collector console
 Keyboard-driven console for the Evil Crow "Scarecrow" receive-only sub-GHz
 sensor. Joins the collector's Wi-Fi AP and shows live direction-finding,
 the signature library, band occupancy, and remote band control over the
 firmware's existing HTTP endpoints. Receive-only: no transmit path.
 Built for the M5Stack Cardputer Zero (Raspberry Pi CM0 / Linux).
